<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Mod id="2e9875c2-6b29-4ccb-acea-399aebf202e5" version="2">
  <Properties>
    <Name>MLK Memorial Wonder</Name>
    <Teaser>Situated at 1964 Independence Avenue, Washington DC, the Martin Luther King Memorial was constructed in 2011, and inspired</Teaser>
    <Description>Situated at 1964 Independence Avenue, Washington DC, the Martin Luther King Memorial was constructed in 2011, and inspired by the quote "Out of a Mountain of Despair, a stone of hope", taken from Martin Luther King's famous "I have a dream" speech. It was built to honour the iconic Civil Rights activist, and the address signifies the year in which he led  thousands in a Civl Rights demonstation during what came to be called the 'March on Washington', and the year in which the Civil Rights act was passed. Ingame, the MLK Memorial provides a +10% boost to global Great Person generation, +5 :c5happy: Happiness with Freedom, and requires Computers.</Description>
    <Authors>Pouakai, sukritact</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>Huehueteotl</SpecialThanks>
